B.J2=new A.af(B.cZ,["Can you clear the hand?","Sets: 3 or more cards of the same rank, all different suits.","Runs: 3 or more consecutive cards of the same suit (Ace low or high, never both).","You may move any card on the table, as long as every group is valid when you confirm.","Goal: play every card from your hand.","Play","Solved!","Your time: {t}","420 more puzzles, a new one every day, and the full game against friends or bots: free in the Ramio app.","Get the app","Play again","This puzzle does not exist.","{de} solved it in {t}. Can you beat that?","A player solved it in {t}. Can you beat that?","Beaten! {t} against {t2}.","Not this time: {t} against {t2}.","Challenge a friend with your time","Link copied: send it to a friend.","I solved this rummy puzzle in {t}. Beat me: {lien}","Faster than {p}% of the {n} players who solved this one.","The next daily challenge starts in {h}: everyone plays the same one, and the app keeps your streak."],t.w)
B.akw=new A.af(B.cZ,["Saurez-vous vider la main ?","Brelans : 3 cartes ou plus de m\xeame valeur, toutes de couleurs diff\xe9rentes.","Suites : 3 cartes ou plus qui se suivent dans la m\xeame couleur (l'As est bas ou haut, jamais les deux).","Toute carte de la table peut \xeatre d\xe9plac\xe9e, tant que chaque groupe est valide au moment de valider.","But : poser toutes les cartes de votre main.","Jouer","R\xe9solu !","Votre temps : {t}","420 autres d\xe9fis, un nouveau chaque jour, et le vrai jeu entre amis ou contre l'ordinateur : gratuit dans l'app Ramio.","Installer l'app","Rejouer","Ce d\xe9fi n'existe pas.","{de} l'a r\xe9solu en {t}. Vous faites mieux ?","Un joueur l'a r\xe9solu en {t}. Vous faites mieux ?","Battu ! {t} contre {t2}.","Pas cette fois : {t} contre {t2}.","D\xe9fier un ami avec votre temps","Lien copi\xe9 : envoyez-le \xe0 un ami.","J'ai r\xe9solu ce d\xe9fi de rami en {t}. Bats-moi : {lien}","Plus rapide que {p} % des {n} joueurs qui l'ont r\xe9solu.","Le prochain d\xe9fi du jour commence dans {h} : tout le monde joue le m\xeame, et l'app garde votre s\xe9rie."],t.w)
B.akC=new A.af(B.cZ,["Schaffst du es, die Hand zu leeren?","Drillinge: 3 oder mehr Karten desselben Werts, alle in verschiedenen Farben.","Folgen: 3 oder mehr aufeinanderfolgende Karten derselben Farbe (das Ass steht unten oder oben, nie beides).","Du darfst jede Karte auf dem Tisch verschieben, solange beim Best\xe4tigen jede Kombination g\xfcltig ist.","Ziel: alle Karten deiner Hand auslegen.","Spielen","Gel\xf6st!","Deine Zeit: {t}","420 weitere R\xe4tsel, jeden Tag ein neues und das ganze Spiel gegen Freunde oder den Computer: kostenlos in der Ramio-App.","App holen","Nochmal spielen","Dieses R\xe4tsel gibt es nicht.","{de} hat es in {t} gel\xf6st. Schaffst du das schneller?","Ein Spieler hat es in {t} gel\xf6st. Schaffst du das schneller?","Geschlagen! {t} gegen {t2}.","Diesmal nicht: {t} gegen {t2}.","Freunde mit deiner Zeit herausfordern","Link kopiert: schick ihn einem Freund.","Ich habe dieses Romm\xe9-R\xe4tsel in {t} gel\xf6st. Schlag mich: {lien}","Schneller als {p} % der {n} Spieler, die es gel\xf6st haben.","Das n\xe4chste R\xe4tsel des Tages startet in {h}: alle spielen dasselbe, und die App z\xe4hlt deine Serie."],t.w)
B.akx=new A.af(B.cZ,["Riesci a svuotare la mano?","Tris: 3 o pi\xf9 carte dello stesso valore, tutte di semi diversi.","Scale: 3 o pi\xf9 carte consecutive dello stesso seme (l'Asso sta in basso o in alto, mai in tutti e due).","Puoi spostare qualsiasi carta sul tavolo, purch\xe9 ogni combinazione sia valida al momento di confermare.","Obiettivo: calare tutte le carte della tua mano.","Gioca","Risolto!","Il tuo tempo: {t}","Altre 420 sfide, una nuova ogni giorno e il gioco completo con gli amici o contro il computer: gratis nell'app Ramio.","Scarica l'app","Gioca ancora","Questa sfida non esiste.","{de} l'ha risolta in {t}. Fai meglio?","Un giocatore l'ha risolta in {t}. Fai meglio?","Battuto! {t} contro {t2}.","Non stavolta: {t} contro {t2}.","Sfida un amico con il tuo tempo","Link copiato: mandalo a un amico.","Ho risolto questa sfida di ramino in {t}. Battimi: {lien}","Pi\xf9 veloce del {p} % dei {n} giocatori che l'hanno risolta.","La prossima sfida del giorno comincia tra {h}: tutti giocano la stessa, e l'app tiene il conto della tua serie."],t.w)
B.akB=new A.af(B.cZ,["\xbfPuedes vaciar tu mano?","Tr\xedos: 3 o m\xe1s cartas del mismo valor, todas de palos distintos.","Escaleras: 3 o m\xe1s cartas seguidas del mismo palo (el As va abajo o arriba, nunca en los dos sitios).","Puedes mover cualquier carta de la mesa, siempre que cada combinaci\xf3n sea v\xe1lida al validar.","Objetivo: bajar todas las cartas de tu mano.","Jugar","\xa1Resuelto!","Tu tiempo: {t}","420 desaf\xedos m\xe1s, uno nuevo cada d\xeda y el juego completo con amigos o contra la m\xe1quina: gratis en la app Ramio.","Descargar la app","Volver a jugar","Este desaf\xedo no existe.","{de} lo resolvi\xf3 en {t}. \xbfLo haces mejor?","Un jugador lo resolvi\xf3 en {t}. \xbfLo haces mejor?","\xa1Superado! {t} contra {t2}.","Esta vez no: {t} contra {t2}.","Reta a un amigo con tu tiempo","Enlace copiado: env\xedaselo a un amigo.","He resuelto este desaf\xedo de rummy en {t}. Sup\xe9rame: {lien}","M\xe1s r\xe1pido que el {p} % de los {n} jugadores que lo resolvieron.","El pr\xf3ximo desaf\xedo del d\xeda empieza en {h}: todos juegan el mismo, y la app guarda tu racha."],t.w)
B.akE=new A.af(B.cZ,["Consegue esvaziar a m\xe3o?","Trios: 3 ou mais cartas do mesmo valor, todas de naipes diferentes.","Sequ\xeancias: 3 ou mais cartas seguidas do mesmo naipe (o \xc1s fica embaixo ou em cima, nunca nos dois).","Voc\xea pode mover qualquer carta da mesa, desde que cada combina\xe7\xe3o esteja v\xe1lida na hora de confirmar.","Objetivo: baixar todas as cartas da sua m\xe3o.","Jogar","Resolvido!","Seu tempo: {t}","Mais 420 desafios, um novo a cada dia e o jogo completo com amigos ou contra o computador: gr\xe1tis no app Ramio.","Baixar o app","Jogar de novo","Este desafio n\xe3o existe.","{de} resolveu em {t}. Voc\xea faz melhor?","Um jogador resolveu em {t}. Voc\xea faz melhor?","Superado! {t} contra {t2}.","Desta vez n\xe3o: {t} contra {t2}.","Desafie um amigo com o seu tempo","Link copiado: mande para um amigo.","Resolvi este desafio de rummy em {t}. Me supere: {lien}","Mais r\xe1pido que {p} % dos {n} jogadores que resolveram este.","O pr\xf3ximo desafio do dia come\xe7a em {h}: todo mundo joga o mesmo, e o app guarda a sua sequ\xeancia."],t.w)
B.aku=new A.af(B.cZ,["Uda ci si\u0119 opr\xf3\u017cni\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119?","Tr\xf3jki: 3 karty lub wi\u0119cej o tej samej warto\u015bci, ka\u017cda w innym kolorze.","Sekwensy: 3 kolejne karty lub wi\u0119cej w tym samym kolorze (as stoi na dole albo na g\xf3rze, nigdy w obu miejscach).","Mo\u017cesz przesun\u0105\u0107 ka\u017cd\u0105 kart\u0119 na stole, o ile przy zatwierdzaniu ka\u017cdy uk\u0142ad jest poprawny.","Cel: wy\u0142o\u017cy\u0107 wszystkie karty z r\u0119ki.","Graj","Rozwi\u0105zane!","Tw\xf3j czas: {t}","Kolejne 420 wyzwa\u0144, nowe ka\u017cdego dnia i pe\u0142na gra ze znajomymi albo z komputerem: za darmo w aplikacji Ramio.","Pobierz aplikacj\u0119","Zagraj jeszcze raz","To wyzwanie nie istnieje.","{de} rozwi\u0105za\u0142 je w {t}. B\u0119dziesz szybszy?","Pewien gracz rozwi\u0105za\u0142 je w {t}. B\u0119dziesz szybszy?","Pobite! {t} wobec {t2}.","Nie tym razem: {t} wobec {t2}.","Rzu\u0107 wyzwanie znajomemu swoim czasem","Link skopiowany: wy\u015blij go znajomemu.","Rozwi\u0105za\u0142em to zadanie z remika w {t}. Pobij mnie: {lien}","Szybciej ni\u017c {p} % z {n} graczy, kt\xf3rzy je rozwi\u0105zali.","Nast\u0119pne wyzwanie dnia zacznie si\u0119 za {h}: wszyscy graj\u0105 to samo, a aplikacja pilnuje twojej serii."],t.w)
B.akA=new A.af(B.cZ,["Reu\u0219e\u0219ti s\u0103 gole\u0219ti m\xe2na?","Triluri: 3 sau mai multe c\u0103r\u021bi de aceea\u0219i valoare, toate de culori diferite.","Chinte: 3 sau mai multe c\u0103r\u021bi consecutive de aceea\u0219i culoare (asul st\u0103 jos sau sus, niciodat\u0103 \xeen ambele p\u0103r\u021bi).","Po\u021bi muta orice carte de pe mas\u0103, at\xe2ta timp c\xe2t fiecare forma\u021bie este valid\u0103 \xeen momentul confirm\u0103rii.","Scopul: s\u0103 etalezi toate c\u0103r\u021bile din m\xe2n\u0103.","Joac\u0103","Rezolvat!","Timpul t\u0103u: {t}","\xcenc\u0103 420 de provoc\u0103ri, una nou\u0103 \xeen fiecare zi \u0219i jocul complet cu prietenii sau contra calculatorului: gratuit \xeen aplica\u021bia Ramio.","Descarc\u0103 aplica\u021bia","Joac\u0103 din nou","Aceast\u0103 provocare nu exist\u0103.","{de} a rezolvat-o \xeen {t}. Faci mai bine?","Un juc\u0103tor a rezolvat-o \xeen {t}. Faci mai bine?","\xcenvins! {t} fa\u021b\u0103 de {t2}.","Nu de data asta: {t} fa\u021b\u0103 de {t2}.","Provoac\u0103 un prieten cu timpul t\u0103u","Link copiat: trimite-l unui prieten.","Am rezolvat aceast\u0103 provocare de remi \xeen {t}. \xcentrece-m\u0103: {lien}","Mai rapid dec\xe2t {p} % dintre cei {n} juc\u0103tori care au rezolvat-o.","Urm\u0103toarea provocare a zilei \xeencepe \xeen {h}: toat\u0103 lumea joac\u0103 aceea\u0219i, iar aplica\u021bia \xee\u021bi \u021bine seria."],t.w)
B.akz=new A.af(B.cZ,["Ki tudod \xfcr\xedteni a kezed?","Drillek: 3 vagy t\xf6bb azonos \xe9rt\xe9k\u0171 lap, mind k\xfcl\xf6nb\xf6z\u0151 sz\xednben.","Sorok: 3 vagy t\xf6bb egym\xe1st k\xf6vet\u0151 lap azonos sz\xednben (az \xe1sz alul vagy fel\xfcl \xe1ll, sosem mindkett\u0151).","Az asztalon b\xe1rmelyik lapot \xe1thelyezheted, am\xedg meger\u0151s\xedt\xe9skor minden kombin\xe1ci\xf3 \xe9rv\xe9nyes.","A c\xe9l: lerakni a kezedben l\xe9v\u0151 \xf6sszes lapot.","J\xe1t\xe9k","Megoldva!","Az id\u0151d: {t}","Tov\xe1bbi 420 kih\xedv\xe1s, minden nap egy \xfaj, \xe9s a teljes j\xe1t\xe9k bar\xe1tokkal vagy g\xe9p ellen: ingyen a Ramio appban.","Az app let\xf6lt\xe9se","\xdajra j\xe1tszom","Ez a kih\xedv\xe1s nem l\xe9tezik.","{de} {t} alatt oldotta meg. Tudsz jobbat?","Egy j\xe1t\xe9kos {t} alatt oldotta meg. Tudsz jobbat?","Megvan! {t} a {t2} ellen.","Most nem siker\xfclt: {t} a {t2} ellen.","H\xedvd ki egy bar\xe1todat az id\u0151ddel","Link m\xe1solva: k\xfcldd el egy bar\xe1todnak.","Ezt a r\xf6mifeladv\xe1nyt {t} alatt oldottam meg. M\xfalj fel\xfcl: {lien}","Gyorsabb vagy, mint az azt megold\xf3 {n} j\xe1t\xe9kos {p} %-a.","A k\xf6vetkez\u0151 napi kih\xedv\xe1s {h} m\xfalva indul: mindenki ugyanazt j\xe1tssza, \xe9s az app sz\xe1molja a sorozatodat."],t.w)
B.aky=new A.af(B.cZ,["Elindeki kartlar\u0131 bitirebilir misin?","\xdc\xe7l\xfcler: ayn\u0131 de\u011ferde, hepsi farkl\u0131 renkte 3 veya daha fazla kart.","Seriler: ayn\u0131 renkte ard\u0131\u015f\u0131k 3 veya daha fazla kart (as ya en altta ya en \xfcstte olur, ikisi birden olmaz).","Masadaki her kart\u0131 ta\u015f\u0131yabilirsin; yeter ki onaylad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda her per ge\xe7erli olsun.","Ama\xe7: elindeki b\xfct\xfcn kartlar\u0131 a\xe7mak.","Oyna","\xc7\xf6z\xfcld\xfc!","S\xfcren: {t}","420 bulmaca daha, her g\xfcn yenisi ve arkada\u015flar\u0131na ya da bilgisayara kar\u015f\u0131 oyunun tamam\u0131: Ramio uygulamas\u0131nda \xfccretsiz.","Uygulamay\u0131 indir","Tekrar oyna","Bu bulmaca yok.","{de} bunu {t} i\xe7inde \xe7\xf6zd\xfc. Daha iyisini yapar m\u0131s\u0131n?","Bir oyuncu bunu {t} i\xe7inde \xe7\xf6zd\xfc. Daha iyisini yapar m\u0131s\u0131n?","Ge\xe7tin! {t} / {t2}.","Bu sefer olmad\u0131: {t} / {t2}.","S\xfcrenle bir arkada\u015f\u0131na meydan oku","Ba\u011flant\u0131 kopyaland\u0131: bir arkada\u015f\u0131na g\xf6nder.","Bu remi bulmacas\u0131n\u0131 {t} i\xe7inde \xe7\xf6zd\xfcm. Beni ge\xe7: {lien}","Bunu \xe7\xf6zen {n} oyuncunun % {p} kadar\u0131ndan daha h\u0131zl\u0131s\u0131n.","G\xfcn\xfcn yeni bulmacas\u0131 {h} sonra ba\u015fl\u0131yor: herkes ayn\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 oynuyor, seriyi de uygulama tutuyor."],t.w)
B.akD=new A.af(B.cZ,["Krijg jij je hand leeg?","Groepen: 3 of meer kaarten van dezelfde waarde, allemaal in een andere kleur.","Reeksen: 3 of meer opeenvolgende kaarten van dezelfde kleur (de aas is laag of hoog, nooit allebei).","Je mag elke kaart op tafel verplaatsen, zolang elke combinatie geldig is als je bevestigt.","Doel: alle kaarten uit je hand neerleggen.","Spelen","Opgelost!","Jouw tijd: {t}","Nog 420 puzzels, elke dag een nieuwe, en het volledige spel met vrienden of tegen de bot: gratis in de Ramio-app.","Download de app","Opnieuw spelen","Deze puzzel bestaat niet.","{de} loste hem op in {t}. Kun jij het sneller?","Een speler loste hem op in {t}. Kun jij het sneller?","Gewonnen! {t} tegen {t2}.","Deze keer niet: {t} tegen {t2}.","Daag een vriend uit met jouw tijd","Link gekopieerd: stuur hem naar een vriend.","Ik heb deze rummypuzzel in {t} opgelost. Versla mij: {lien}","Sneller dan {p}% van de {n} spelers die hem hebben opgelost.","De volgende puzzel van de dag begint over {h}: iedereen speelt dezelfde en de app houdt je serie bij."],t.w)
